SUMMARY:Virtual: Morning Yoga with Senseful Wellness
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nJoin Jenn & Vi Thursday mornings from\n10
 :30 am -11:30 am\nAll of April and May as we travel around the US.\n\nWe w
 ill meet on our mats and drop into gentle beginner friendly flows to kick 
 start the day by dropping into gentle our body.\n\nThese are donation base
 d classes\n[Venmo](https://venmo.com/code?user_id=3167850957111296750&crea
 ted=1774809311.364578&printed=1)\nPayPal:@jenniferwilson429\nall humans an
 d bodies welcome
